<title>MALAYSIA: Ringgit stays quiet, seen rangebound.</title>
<headline>Ringgit stays quiet, seen rangebound.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Previous	Forecast	Resistance    Support</p>
<p>    2.5070/96     2.5060/5100    2.5050	 2.5150</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>* Ringgit remained still due to lack of participation and fresh leads</p>
<p>* Holidays in Tokyo and London seen limiting activity</p>
<p>* Corporate demand for dollar likely to limit ringgit's upside</p>
<p>The ringgit remained locked in a tight range against the dollar in early Asian trading due to lack of of both participation and fresh leads, dealers said.</p>
</text>
